\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\">\\(s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_L\\)</span> (structural satisfaction predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Satisfies}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Satisfies}_L\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (notation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Satisfies}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Satisfies}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\varphi[s]\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Satisfies}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\varphi[s]\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Satisfies}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The equality, relation, Boolean, and quantifier clauses—including assignment update\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[a/x]\">\\(s[a/x]\\)</span>—are defined once in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>.  The present atom supplies only\nthe conventional notation for that predicate.</p>\n<p>原书 1.3.14–1.3.15 使用有限序列及原始合取；本地使用总赋值及原始蕴涵。两种表述分别经有限限制和布尔缩写对应，不改变满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-stru